{"unit_id":"superdesigndev__superdesign-skill#feature-01","repo":"superdesigndev/superdesign-skill","commit":"f9f05cd988c247dce6c072eaf9ac6b162f2ffc4b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Superdesign 的功能「界面设计与迭代」：技能引导 agent 分析现有项目或从新项目开始，创建页面草稿并按用户反馈迭代。通过 Superdesign CLI 和画布流程触发，输出可查看和继续修改的设计草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/superdesign/SKILL.md:1-17","skills/superdesign/references/SUPERDESIGN.md:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"superdesigndev__superdesign-skill#feature-02","repo":"superdesigndev/superdesign-skill","commit":"f9f05cd988c247dce6c072eaf9ac6b162f2ffc4b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Superdesign 的功能「设计系统与组件」：技能指导从代码库提取设计上下文、建立设计系统，并将可复用界面组件转为画布组件。用户提出相关设计任务时按指南调用 CLI，输出项目设计上下文和可复用组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/superdesign/references/INIT.md:1-35","skills/superdesign/references/COMPONENTS.md:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"superdesigndev__superdesign-skill#feature-03","repo":"superdesigndev/superdesign-skill","commit":"f9f05cd988c247dce6c072eaf9ac6b162f2ffc4b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Superdesign 的功能「网站风格提取」：用户提供公开网站 URL 后，技能指导调用 extract-website 获取设计说明、token 或内容结构，再用于设计工作流。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/superdesign/references/WEBSITE.md:1-25"]}
{"unit_id":"superdesigndev__superdesign-skill#feature-04","repo":"superdesigndev/superdesign-skill","commit":"f9f05cd988c247dce6c072eaf9ac6b162f2ffc4b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Superdesign 的功能「演示文稿生成」：技能按演示文稿指南先整理并让用户审批可编辑大纲，再通过 CLI 生成演示稿，并支持面向幻灯片的迭代。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/superdesign/references/PRESENTATION.md:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"superdesigndev__superdesign-skill#feature-05","repo":"superdesigndev/superdesign-skill","commit":"f9f05cd988c247dce6c072eaf9ac6b162f2ffc4b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Superdesign 的功能「图形与素材工作流」：技能指导制作海报、封面和营销图形，并按素材用途选择生成图片或视频、上传并引用到设计草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/superdesign/references/GRAPHIC.md:1-25","skills/superdesign/references/ASSET_GENERATION.md:1-25"]}
